2026-07-27T10:36:33.4291738Z i /tmp/RtmpuLDAv3/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4292003Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4292311Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4292588Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4292982Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4293523Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:36:33.4294280Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
